[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
So turns out maintaining a simple status page with two mere
HTML pages and an XML page, whose process of updating has
long been automated by Perl scripts and Template Toolkit...
isn't [% WRAPPER $qnam %]simple[% END %] in the slightest.  My goal with writing this,
however, is not so you would pity me.  I've been pretty
selfish doing what I want to do, mostly unrelated to the web
sites, and almost never related to school.  It's like um...
how you hear certain people partying in their room after the
finals are over, except if you walk over there and tell them
"hey, you might want to take a break..." you are greeted with
a firm and adamant stubbornness of insisting that they're
doing the right thing.
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
[% dots %] which I'm not saying that I think I am.  I know I've
been staying on my bed with just my laptop for a week or so
now.  I know it's probably best that I live like a normal
person more, which hopefully means I can go to sleep early
and not feel sleepy after being awake for only a few hours.
[% dots %] and i guess i feel sorry for letting mom worry[% dots.repeat(2) %].
I just don't know when I'll get things done if not[% dots %] now.
Things move so fast, before I know it I'd be back[% dash %]and I
definitely can't return with my phone still at full storage!
(And uh, my obsession with getting everything figured out
and resolved at the same time I come across them =n=)
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
But well... personal rant aside, today is supposedly the last
day of December (by the way the time just hit midnight as i
was finishing up the first paragraph, but you probably knew
what time that, everyone probably tells you about it... the
Earth made a full cycle around the Sun, and everyone just got
[%- BLOCK link %]<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Asian_age_reckoning#China">[% content %]</a>[% END %]
a year older (at least [% WRAPPER link %]if you are Chinese[% END %])... It's not like
I don't know it's 2025 that's kind of why I am writing this
but it's also not like the whole point, plus it just so
happens to be a year or so since rapidcow.org has been up!
so i can finally do some analysis of the web traffic- okay
you know what it KIND OF has to do with that it's 2025[% dots %])
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
*ahem* sorry[% dash %]AS I WAS SAYING THOUGH it's the end of a
month, end of a year too (not a very happy year for me bu-
ok I need to stop going off the track), and this status page
(or pages if you will) went through THREE different hosts.
Like, that's INSANE!  The second part was kind of my fault
though, but I'll get to all of that here.  (Oh, and I feel
obliged to say this[% dots %] This update will be a bit technical,
but I feel like I should respect your choice to learn more
about what happens, rather than hide those away from you.
If you dislike the technical bits, then it's alright, but then
I hope you can see kind of the whole point of this post is[% dots %]
to explain the technical stuff.  That is the powerhouse of a
website, the web server, the host[% dots %] and what I use to make
sure that everything is running (unless your ISP bans foreign
websites[% dash %]sorry, I don't think I have the knowledge to
deal with that yet[% dots %] :c))
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
First off you may have noticed that the "hosted by codeberg"
part is not at all accurate, and, indeed if you try to access
pages.status.rapidcow.codeberg.page (where the old CNAME record
pointed to), you would find that the 4xx error is still there:
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<pre><code>[% END %]
[%- FILTER html -%]
$ openssl s_client -crlf -nocommands -connect pages.status.rapidcow.codeberg.page:443
